    "question": {
      ":question/id": "13dad157-5fb1-55b9-9538-b0717dd4c49e",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+2y &=3 \\\\ 3x+8y &=9 \\\\ -2x-6y &=-6\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 3 & 8 & 9 \\\\ -2 & -6 & -6\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 3 & 8 & 9 \\\\ -2 & -6 & -6\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+(-3){R}_{1} \\\\ & \u223c\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ -2 & -6 & -6\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(2){R}_{1} \\\\ & \u223c\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 0\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(1){R}_{2} \\\\ & \u223c\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThere is a pivot for each variable and no contradictory row. The system has a unique solution, so we conclude that the system is consistent independent.\n\nAs a result, select: The system is consistent independent.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "cf5918f9-8c2f-5f5c-9693-36162004ea91",
