      ":question/id": "5e80bc6f-9352-50c0-9a26-d1555a0fdd4d",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-3y &=3 \\\\ -3x+9y &=-8 \\\\ 2x-6y &=6\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -3 & 3 \\\\ -3 & 9 & -8 \\\\ 2 & -6 & 6\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -3 & 3 \\\\ -3 & 9 & -8 \\\\ 2 & -6 & 6\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+(3){R}_{1} \\\\ & \u223c\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -3 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 2 & -6 & 6\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(-2){R}_{1} \\\\ & \u223c\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -3 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe final row corresponds to the equation $0x+0y=1,$ and this has no solution. Therefore, our system has no solution, and we conclude that the system is inconsistent.\n\nAs a result, select: The system is inconsistent.",
